<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">- Mpoto Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">2 Timoseo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Balua ja kabele jaka Paulo kwaka Timoseo</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Timoseo</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Timo</para>
  <para style="mt2">Balua ja kabheli jaka Paulo kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Timoseo</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongulelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha kabheli chaka Timoseo nde baluwa ja kabheli yeilembakiki na Mtumi Paulo kujenda kwaka mbolwa waki Timoseo. Baluwa ja kabheli jaka Timoseo jakalembakiki pambipi na ujomukelu wa matamu ghaka Paulo. Mu chikahi chenihechi, Paulo akabhi muchifungo ku muchi wa ku Loma (Sula 1:16). Paulo akabhi na ujonganu wa pambipi nakanopi na Timoseo, na mala pamaheli akundohiki mwana waki (Filimoni 2:22, 1 Timoseo 1:2, 18).</para>
  <para style="ip">Jenjenu nde jimu ja baluwa nchechi kuhuma kwaka Paulo ambayu ikalembakiki kwa bhandu bheni, wala nga kwa likanisa. Baluwa yengi hitatu nde 1 Timoseo, na Tito na Filimoni. Chikahi baluwa ja kabheli jaka Timoseo pajalembakiki, Bhakristo mu inchi ja Kiloma bhakabhi bhang'ahakika. Iwezikana nde kwa ndandi jeniheji Paulo akabhi muchifungo, na kunjomalake Timoseo ahinakyaje paapetela mambu ghaghanonwipe. Ngati mokubhi mu 1 Timoseo, Paulo ampekeha Timoseo malakalilu ghamaheli kubhokana na bhabhola bha upuhe (1 Timoseo 1:16-18). Ampwaghila kabheti Timoseo kubha palongi ja mwanja unakubya na chikahi cha kunonopa na cha mang'ahiku (Sula 3:1).</para>
  <para style="iot">Ghaghabhihomu</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo atumbula kwa kundamukila Timoseo (Sula 1:1-2) na kabheti anjeghela mtima (Sula 1:3-18).</para>
  <para style="io">Kabheti Paulo anjomalakela Timoseo kubha wa kuhinakila na wa ukangamalu (Sula 2:1-13).</para>
  <para style="io">Baada ja panihapa ampekeha malaghalakilu gha papamu (Sula 2:14-26).</para>
  <para style="io">Kabheti andakalila panani ja mapitalilu gha mambu ghaghahika, na kundangiha indela jamboni ja kujepana naghu (Sula 3:1-4:8).</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo ajomulela kwa kumpekeha Timoseo malaghalakilu kwaka Timoseo mweni (Sula 4:9-24).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1"/>Nepani Paulo, mtumi waka Kristo Yesu kwa mapalu ghaka Chapanga nahuli ndangaza chilanga chela cha womi chechibhi kwa kulombana na Kristo Yesu.<verse eid="2TI 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2"/>Nukulembe wehapa wa Timoseo wa mwanangu mpalu:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 1:2">Nukulobhela chihomu, na chiha na lukwali, yeihuma kwaka Chapanga Atati na kwaka Kristo Yesu Bambo witu.<verse eid="2TI 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Uchengulu na kujeghaleka mtima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3"/>Nunchengu Chapanga, jonunjojabhela kwa zamili jinyahi ngati mobhakatendili bhazee bhangu. Nunchengu Chapanga panunkomboka ikilu na muhi mu malobhu ghangu. <verse eid="2TI 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4"/>Naghakomboka maholi ghako, na ndokulela namaa kukubhona nahuli mbata kutwelakewa chiheku. <verse eid="2TI 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5"/>Ngomboka uhobhalelu waku wa chakaka, uhobhalelu ghoakabhi nau ambuja waku Loisi na mabhu waku Eunike. Nanatu bhelabhela nhobhalela sajenu wehapa ubhi nau uhobhalelu hoghu. <verse eid="2TI 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6"/>Kwa ndandi jenu nukukombukela ukokakyaje nhupu yela yaka Chapanga, yeibhekakiki mkati jaku panakakubhekili mabhoku ghangu na kukulobhela. <verse eid="2TI 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7"/>Maghambu Chapanga ngacheakatupekihi Roho wa choghohi, nambu Roho wa makili, wa upalu na wa mtima wa kulijemalela.<verse eid="2TI 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8"/>Henu ngawibhona ihoni kundandila Bambo witu, wala ngawibhona ihoni kwa ndandi jangu nepani nengongakiki kwa ndandi jaki, nambu uhinakalyaje mang'ahiku papamu na nepani kwa ndandi ja Malobhi Manyahi, kwa makili ghaupekewa na Chapanga. <verse eid="2TI 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9"/>Jombi akatukengalili na akatulohiki tutamaje matamu mahuhu, nga kwa kulengana na matendu ghitu ghamboni nambu ngati bhela moakapali mweni na chihomu chaki. Chihomu hechi tupekiwi muka Kristo Yesu mangani ja kutumbula kwa chikahi, <verse eid="2TI 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10"/>nambu sajenu chiyekuliwi kwitu kwa kuhika kwaki Mkengalela witu, Kristo Yesu. Jombi ayoningi makili gha nyiwa, na kwa indela ja Malobhi Manyahi auyekwi womi wanga na nyiwa.<verse eid="2TI 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11"/>Chapanga anhawi mya mtumi na mbola kwa ndandi ja kutangaza Malobhi Manyahi. <verse eid="2TI 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12"/>Kwa ndandi jeniheji nde ng'ahika ntundu ghoni. Nambu ngachemona ihoni kwa ndandi nummanyi jombi jonunhobhalela, bhela nhobhale nakanopi kubha aweza kuchilenda wichu chela cheambekihe mbaka Lichobha lela. <verse eid="2TI 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13"/>Kamulakya wichu malobhi ghala ghaghabhi na womi ghanukubholiki, na uhighalya mu uhobhalelu na upalu ghoubhi mu kulombana na Kristo Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14"/>Ulilendaje lijambu lela lamboni leupekiwi kwa makili ghaka Roho Mhuhu joatama mkati jitu.<verse eid="2TI 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15"/>Wehapa umanyi kubha bhandu bhokapi mu Asia bhanekike, hata Figelo na Helimogene bhanekike. <verse eid="2TI 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16"/>Bambo abhabhonila chiha bhandu bha munyumba jaka Onesifolo, kwa ndandi akanihekihi mala pamaheli, na ngacheaweni ihoni chikahi panakabhi muchifungu, <verse eid="2TI 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17"/>nambu paakahikiki pani pa Loma, akanondiki namaa mbaka akambatike. <verse eid="2TI 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18"/>Bambo na ampekyaje kupata chiha chaki Lichobha lela! Na wehapa umanyi wichu ntundu moakanyangatili ku Efeso hoku.<verse eid="2TI 1:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2"/>
  <para style="s">Linjolinjoli ndongwana waka Yesu Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1"/>Henu, wehapa wa mwanangu, Chapanga akupekya ukangamalu mu chihomu chetupata mu kulombana na Kristo Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2"/>Na mabholu ghala ghawajowini nakatangazaje palongi ja bhalandila bhamaheli, uwapekya bhandu bhalongwana bhabhiweza kubhabhola bhandu bhangi bhelabhela.<verse eid="2TI 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3"/>Hinakyaje mang'ahiku papamu na nepani ngati linjolinjoli ndongwana waka Kristo Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4"/>Linjolinjoli kungondu alijepa na lihengu la matamu gha kawaida, nahuli aweza kunyambiha jola joambekiki kubha linjolinjoli. <verse eid="2TI 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5"/>Bhelabhela mundu joakembela na bhajaki mu imbelu, ngacheaweza kujopale nhupu ja ushindi ngati ngacheakajengali shelia ja imbelu. <verse eid="2TI 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6"/>Ndemi joahenga lihengu nakanopi nde joapalika kubha wa kutumbula kupata mahunu. <verse eid="2TI 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7"/>Holalyaje namaa ghangani ghanukupwaghila kwa ndandi Bambo anaakupekya umanyi mu mambu ghanihagha ghokapi.<verse eid="2TI 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8"/>Unkombukaje Yesu Kristo, joakahyokiki kuhuma kwa bhakuwa, joakabhi wa lubheleku lwaka Daude, ngati moghapwaghi Malobhi Manyahi ghandangaza. <verse eid="2TI 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9"/>Na kwa ndandi ndangaza Malobhi Manyahi, nepani ng'ahika na kukongakeka muchifungo ngati muhakau. Nambu Lilobhi laka Chapanga ngacheliweza kukongakeka muchifungo. <verse eid="2TI 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10"/>Kwa bhela nhinakila mambu ghokapi kwa ndandi ja bhahaghulika bhaka Chapanga, nahuli na bhombi bhapata ukengaleku ghoubhi muka Kristo Yesu, papamu na ulumbalilu wa mileli. <verse eid="2TI 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11"/>Lendenu nde lilobhi la chakaka:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:11">“Ngati anatupotili papamu naku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:11">anatutamaje kabhete papamu naku.<verse eid="2TI 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12"/>Ngati anatuhinakili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:12">bhelabhela anatutawalaje papamu naku.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:12">Na ngati anatunkaniki jombi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:12">najombi bhelabhela anaatukana tepani.<verse eid="2TI 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13"/>Ngati tepani anatubhi ngatwalongwana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:13">jombi atamakila kubha ndongwana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:13">kwa ndandi ngacheaweza kung'anambuka kwa ghala ghaakapwaghike.”<verse eid="2TI 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mhenga lihengu joajetakaliwi na Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14"/>Ubhakombukya bhandu mambu ghanihagha na kubhalakalila palongi jaka Chapanga, bhakotuka kulochana panani ja malobhi ghani. Kulochana hoku ngachekupalika, nambu kuleta pena uyonangeku ukolongwa kwa bhala bhabhajowana. <verse eid="2TI 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15"/>Ukangamalaje kulilangi kubha ujetakaliwi na Chapanga, ngati muhenga lihengu joahenga lihengu laki koni ngachealibhone ihoni lihengu laki na ambaju abhola wichu ubholu wa chakaka waka Chapanga. <verse eid="2TI 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16"/>Ulijepaje na malobhi mahakau, na gha king'ang'a, maghambu kwa ghanihagha ghajonjuke kubhabheka bhandu kutali na Chapanga. <verse eid="2TI 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17"/>Mabholu gha ntundu ghonihoghu ghajaghanila ngati chilonda changakulama na chechikula hyegha. Pachilanda ja bhandu bhabhabholiki ghanihagha abhi Himenayo na Fileto. <verse eid="2TI 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18"/>Bhanihabha bhajilekiki indela ja chakaka, na kuyonanga uhobhalelu wa bhandu bhangi kwa kupwagha eti uhyoheku witu ujomwili kutendakeka. <verse eid="2TI 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19"/>Nambu luhuli lwaka Chapanga lujemiki kwa ukangamalu, na panani jaki palembakiki ana: “Bambo abhamanyi bhabhabhi bhaki,” na “Kila joapwagha kubha nepani nde waka Bambo na aulekaje uhakau.”<verse eid="2TI 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20"/>Mu nyumba ngolongwa kubhi na mbale na yombu ya kila ntundu: Yengi ilenganakiki kwa madini gha feza na zahabu, yengi ya mikongu na lutopi, yengi ya kutumika kwa utopelu na yengi kutumika panga utopelu. <verse eid="2TI 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21"/>Bhela anakubhi mundu aligholwili kwa kulibheka kutali kuhuma mu hyombu yela yanga utopelu, anakubha chombu cha kupata utopelu, ahaghuliwi na kunyambiha Bambo waki, na alenganakiki kwa kila lihengu lelibhi lambone. <verse eid="2TI 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22"/>Utilaje utokulelu uhakau wa ukombu, ukangamala kujengalela kutama ngati moapali Chapanga, uhobhalelu, upalu na lukwali papamu na bhala bhabhundoha Bambo kwa mtima wamboni. <verse eid="2TI 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23"/>Ulijepaje na malalukilu gha ching'ang'a na ghangakubha na ndandi, maghambu umanyi kubha ghanihagha ghaleta kulochana. <verse eid="2TI 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24"/>Kabheti ngacheipalika mtumika waka Bambo kubha na milomu, nambu impalika akubha mpole kwa bhandu bhokapi, joaweza kubhola na joahinakila, <verse eid="2TI 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25"/>abhalakalya kwa upole bhandu bhala bhabhapengana naku, nahuli ngati anaiwezakini, Chapanga abhapekya mbekenyu ja kung'anambuka na kughaleka mahoku na kuumanya uchakaka. <verse eid="2TI 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26"/>Panihapa maholalelu ghabhu anaghalamuka kabhete, na bhombi anabhalemikaje mu chimbenda chaka Muhakau, ambachu bhanihabha bhakapendakaliwi naku, na kubhatenda bhapata kutenda mapalu ghaki.<verse eid="2TI 2:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3"/>
  <para style="s">Machobha gha ujomukelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1"/>Ukombuka kubha, mu machobha gha ujomukelu anakubya na chikahi cha mang'ahiku makolongwa. <verse eid="2TI 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2"/>Maghambu bhandu anabhakubha bha kulipala bheni, bhabhapala mbija, bhabhapala kulilumbalila, bhabhabhi na ing'omu, bhabhuntondola Chapanga, bhangakubhatii bhabheleka bhabhu, bhangakubha na uchengulu, bhangakubha bhahuhu, <verse eid="2TI 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3"/>bhangakubha na upalu, bhangakupala kujongana, bhabhakopunganela, bhangakulihibhalakila matokuelu ghabhu na bhakale, bhangakupala ghambone, <verse eid="2TI 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4"/>bhabhang'anambuka bhajabhu, bhabhabhi na ing'omu, bhabhatweli kulibhona, bhabhapala kutama matamu mahakau kuliku kumpala Chapanga. <verse eid="2TI 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5"/>Kwa kunja bhabhonikana ngati bhandu bhabhunjojabhe Chapanga, nambu bhaghakana makili ghaki. Ulijepaje na bhandu bha ntundu ghonihoghu. <verse eid="2TI 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6"/>Bhakumu bhabhu bhajenda mu nyumba ya bhandu na kubhakolowa akambomba bhang'ang'a nahuli bhabhajowanya bhombe, akambomba bhabhabhi na hibwahila ya mahoku na kulonguheka na ntundu wokapi wa utokulelu uhakau. <verse eid="2TI 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7"/>Akambomba bhanihabha bhalibhola machobha ghokapi, nambu ngachebhaweza kuuhikila umanyi wa chakaka ng'o. <verse eid="2TI 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8"/>Bhandu bhanihabha bhaukaniki uchakaka ngati Yane na Yamble mobhakumpengi Musa, bhelabhela bhandu bhanihabha bhapengana na chakaka jela. Bhanihabha nde bhandu bhabhabhi na malangu ghaghayonangiki, na bhakanakiki kwa mambu gha uhobhalelu. <verse eid="2TI 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9"/>Nambu ngabhawezi kujendalela nakanopi maghambu ung'ang'a wabhu anaubhonikana palanga ja bhandu bhokapi. Nde mokukabheli kwaka Yane na Yamble.<verse eid="2TI 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malaghalakilu gha kujomulela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10"/>Nambu wehapa wa Timoseo, ughajengalyaje mabholu ghangu, na ntundu mondamila, na chembalikaje mu matamu ghangu, uhobhalelu wangu, uhinakalilu wangu, upalu wangu, na kulendalela kwangu, <verse eid="2TI 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11"/>mang'ahiku na kulagha. Ughamanyi mambu ghaghambatiki ku muchi wa ku Antiokia, ku Ikonio na ku Listila hoku. Nakahinaki mang'ahiku ghokapi nambu Bambo akangengalili mu ghanihagha ghokapi. <verse eid="2TI 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12"/>Kila mundu joapala kutama matamu gha uhuhu mu kulombana na Kristo Yesu anang'ahikaje, <verse eid="2TI 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13"/>nambu bhandu bhahakau na bhabhakolowa anabhapetalyaje kubha bhahakau, bhakakoluwaji na koni bheni bhakoluweka. <verse eid="2TI 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14"/>Nambu wehapa utamaje mu uchakaka ghola ghoukalibholiki na kuhobhalela nakanope. Kwa ndandi ubhamanyi bhala bhabhukubholike, <verse eid="2TI 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15"/>nanau ukombukaje kutumbu umwana waku ughamanyi Malembu Mahuhu ambaghu ghaweza kukupekeha mbulau nahuli ukengaliwaje kwa indela ja uhobhalelu kwaka Kristo Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16"/>Kila lilembu lelibhi na mbomu jaka Chapanga lilenganela mu kubholela uchakaka, kulakalila na kubhalangiha bhandu mahakau ghabhu, na kubhalongoha bhatamaje mu matamu ghamboni, <verse eid="2TI 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17"/>nahuli mundu waka Chapanga abya na kila chindu chechipalika kwa kuntumaki jombi, nahuli apata kutenda kila lihengu lamboni.<verse eid="2TI 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1"/>Nukulaghalaki palongi jaka Chapanga, na palongi jaka Kristo Yesu, joanatemulaje bhandu bhabhabhi bhomi na bhabhapotile, na kwa ndandi ahika kutawala akabya Nkolongwa: <verse eid="2TI 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2"/>Ubhatangazya bhandu ubholu hoghu, ubya wichu kwa chikahi cha kupalika au chikahi changakupalika, kanakyaje, kenjukyaje na ubhajeghala mtima kwa uhinakilu na kubhabhola kwa uhinakalilu wokapi. <verse eid="2TI 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3"/>Maghambu chikahi anachihikaje bhandu anabhakanaje kughajowanela mabholu gha chakaka gha womi, nambu anabhajengalyaje utokulelu wabhu bhene na kuwongana bhabhola bhamaheli bhapata kubhapwaghila mambu ghala pena ambaghu makutu ghabhu ghapala kughajowana. <verse eid="2TI 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4"/>Anabhakanaje kuujowana uchakaka, anabhang'anambukyaje hadisi ya upuhe. <verse eid="2TI 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5"/>Nambu wehapa ukubha mihu chikahi chokapi, hinakalyaje mang'ahiku, tenda lihengu la kutangaza Malobhi Manyahi, jomulakyaje ghaghapalika mu lihengu lako.<verse eid="2TI 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6"/>Kwa upambala wangu nepani mi pambipi namaa kubhohakeka ngati nyambiku ja kupongola, na chikahi cha kupotela kwangu chiheghalile. <verse eid="2TI 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7"/>Ngomini ngondu wichu, mwanja nyomwile, na uhobhalelu nuulendike. <verse eid="2TI 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8"/>Sajenu nendale kupekewa litaji la kutama matamu gha kujetakalewa palongi jaka Chapanga. Bambo mtemula wambone, anaambekya nhupu heji Lichobha lela, wala nga nepani pena, nambu na bhandu bhokapi kabhete ambabhu bhalendalili kwa chilolu kubhonikana kwaki.<verse eid="2TI 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo andaghalaki Timoseo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9"/>Kangamalaje uhika kwangu manyata. <verse eid="2TI 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10"/>Kwa ndandi Dema, kwa kuupala ndema, anekiki na kujenda ku Sesalonike. Kleske apiti ku Galatia na Tito apiti ku Dalimatia. <verse eid="2TI 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11"/>Luka kanjika jaki nde joabhi pambane papamu na nepane. Untola Mako uhika naku kwa ndandi aweza kunyangatila mu lihengu langu. <verse eid="2TI 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12"/>Nuntumiki Tikiko ku Efeso hoku. <verse eid="2TI 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13"/>Pawihikaje unetilaje likoti langu lenililekiki kwaka Kuplo kola ku Tiloa, na bhelabhela unetila hitabu, nakanopi hitabu yela yeilenganakiki kwa chingokolu.<verse eid="2TI 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14"/>Alekizanda, mponda choma jola akandendili uhakau ukolongwa. Bambo anaandepaje kwa ndandi ja ghala ghaatendike. <verse eid="2TI 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15"/>Ulilingalya naku kwa ndandi akaupengiki nakanopi ubholu witu.<verse eid="2TI 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16"/>Panakabhi nilikengalela kwa mala ja kutumbula njeta mundu joakajemiki upambala wangu, nambu bhokapi bhakanekiki, nundobha Chapanga ngaabhalangila lihoku kwa lijambu leniheli. <verse eid="2TI 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17"/>Nambu Bambo akajemiki upambala wangu akanyeghili makili, nahuli nabhatangazya bhandu ubholu waki kwa ukangamalu, nahuli bhandu bha mataifa ghokapi bhapata kuujowana. Nepani ngengaliwi kuhuma mu nyiwa ngati kukengalewa kuhuma mu ndomu wa lihimba. <verse eid="2TI 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18"/>Bambo anangengalyaje na mambu ghokapi mahakau, na kumbeleka lukwali mbaka mu Ukolongwa waki wa kunani kumahunde. Alumbalika jombi mileli na mileli! Amina.<verse eid="2TI 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ulamukilu wa kujomulela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19"/>Mubhalamukyaje Pulisila na Akila na bhokapi bha munyumba jaka Onesifolo. <verse eid="2TI 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20"/>Elasto akahighalili ku Kolinso, na Tilofimo nundekiki ku Mileto kwa ndandi akabhi mtamwa. <verse eid="2TI 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21"/>Kangamalaje uhika mangani ja chikahi cha imbepu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 4:21">Eubulo, na Pude na Lino na Klaudia bhukulamukila papamu na bhalongu bhokapi bhabhunhobhalela Kristo.<verse eid="2TI 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22"/>Bambo akubha papamu na roho jako.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 4:22">Chihomu chaka Chapanga chikubha papamu na mwehapa mabhokapi. Amina.<verse eid="2TI 4:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4"/>
</usx>
